++
++| Phase | What | Risk |
++| --- | --- | --- |
++| P0 | This plan, the names, the branch, the new identity (0248, 0249) | none |
++| P1 | The `alloykit` types, `alloys/index.ts`, selection rules, and the **boundary test** that enforces `ALLOYS.md`. Nothing calls it yet | none |
